@baseUrl = http://localhost:5188
@email = foxio.student@example.com
@password = FoxioPass123!

### 1. Register a new student account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "displayName": "James Fox"
}

### 2. Login and capture JWT token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3a. Create Todo #1 (with deadline)
# @name createTodo1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Submit Calculus Assignment",
  "description": "Chapter 4 exercises on integration",
  "deadline": "2026-11-25T17:00:00Z"
}

###
@todoId1 = {{createTodo1.response.body.id}}

### 3b. Create Todo #2 (without deadline)
# @name createTodo2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Review Flutter Riverpod Notes",
  "description": "Prepare for Week 2 offline sync"
}

### 4. Get all active Todos (sorted: incomplete -> nearest deadline -> nulls last)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Update Todo #1
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/{{todoId1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Submit Calculus Assignment (Final)",
  "description": "Double-check all 10 problems before uploading",
  "deadline": "2026-11-26T17:00:00Z"
}

### 6. Complete Todo #1 (expect pointsEarned: 10, totalPoints: 10, level: 1)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/{{todoId1}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isCompleted": true
}

### 7a. Uncomplete Todo #1 (anti-farming test)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/{{todoId1}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isCompleted": false
}

### 7b. Complete Todo #1 again (expect pointsEarned: 0, totalPoints unchanged — no point farming!)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/{{todoId1}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isCompleted": true
}

### 8. Soft delete Todo #1 (expect 204 NoContent)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/{{todoId1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Get all active Todos (verify Todo #1 is excluded)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
